  biography: The god of the mountains and forests, the leader of the "Four Immortals".
    Son Tinh represents the power to control natural disasters and the unwavering
    steadfastness of Mother Vietnam.
  specialSkillName: Mountain- Moving Boulder
  specialSkillDescription: Drawing upon divine strength, Son Tinh effortlessly lifts
    massive boulders with his bare hands and hurls them directly at the enemy ranks.
    The falling boulders create an earth-shattering impact, inflicting heavy damage
    and stunning all enemies in the area, crushing their will to advance and rendering
    them immobile.
